        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mineral that is an inorganic nutrient which must be ingested and absorbed in adequate amounts to satisfy a wide range of essential metabolic and/or structural functions in the human body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
