        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">This entity models a process in disease A&apos;s course that produces a disorder which becomes part of disease B — the complication. The disorder as output is not the disorder of the producing disease but a newly instantiated structural abnormality that grounds a secondary disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:description xml:lang="en">This entity models a process in disease A&apos;s course that produces a disorder which becomes part of disease B — the complication. The disorder as output is not the disorder of the producing disease but a newly instantiated structural abnormality that grounds a secondary disease.</dc:description>
